---
// Figure for the stocks-basics series, Post 8 (macro and industry). Numbers are from the sources cited in the post.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 270;
---
<figure class="sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent">
  <div class="sc">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Four questions to ask before reading a stock: policy rate direction, pressure on the dong, the industry cycle, and the company exposure to debt and USD.">
      <text x="20" y="28" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Four questions before you read a stock</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bốn câu hỏi trước khi đọc một cổ phiếu</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="52" width="420" height="90" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="bank" x={50} y={82} size={26} />
      <text x="78" y="88" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>1. Where is the policy rate going?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Lãi suất điều hành đang đi về đâu?</tspan></text>
      <text x="78" y="116" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Look: SBV decisions and press releases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xem: quyết định và thông cáo của NHNN</tspan></text>
      <rect x="460" y="52" width="420" height="90" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={490} y={82} size={26} />
      <text x="518" y="88" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>2. Is the dong under pressure?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Đồng có đang chịu áp lực?</tspan></text>
      <text x="518" y="116" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Look: central rate, band, bank dollar quotes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xem: tỷ giá trung tâm, biên độ, giá USD ngân hàng</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="156" width="420" height="90" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="chart" x={50} y={186} size={26} />
      <text x="78" y="192" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>3. Where is the industry in its cycle?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. Ngành đang ở đâu trong chu kỳ?</tspan></text>
      <text x="78" y="220" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Look: profit vs its 5-year average (Post 7)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xem: lợi nhuận so với trung bình 5 năm (Bài 7)</tspan></text>
      <rect x="460" y="156" width="420" height="90" rx="10" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="file" x={490} y={186} size={26} />
      <text x="518" y="192" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>4. What does this company owe or earn in USD?</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4. Công ty nợ hay thu USD bao nhiêu?</tspan></text>
      <text x="518" y="220" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Look: debt and FX notes (Post 6)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xem: nợ vay, thuyết minh tỷ giá (Bài 6)</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Answers move slowly; a headline moves fast. Write the four answers down once a quarter and change them only when an official decision or a filing changes them.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Câu trả lời đổi chậm, tiêu đề tin đổi nhanh. Mỗi quý ghi lại bốn câu trả lời và chỉ sửa khi có quyết định chính thức hoặc báo cáo mới.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sc { overflow-x: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .b { font-size: 12.8px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .n { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .grn { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .gld { fill: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .cardr { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .cardg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .cardk { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .lnr { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .lng { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2.4; fill: none; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .barr { fill: var(--red); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .barg { fill: var(--act-2); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .barm { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent .bard { fill: var(--gold); }
  .sbp8-sbp08readthecurrent figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
